<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Mantra</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Hxzz</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">amped</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">DEATH BEFORE DISHONOR</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4ULf19yuHPElz6dlDxe7Xz</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">3 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Love Mania Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Straight down PCH, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">On my way, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sun rays on my face, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Make you wanna taste, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fightin' all week, let's make up</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We gon' make love 'til it's straight, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna play</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your love make me, oh, crazy than a mother, mother</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All night, makin' love, get each other, love each other</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know you know, I can never love another</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I know you go crazy than a mother, mother</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby, don't make that face, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You know the one you make, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna and you don't wanna break up</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We might as well make love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fightin' all week, let's make up</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We gon' make love 'til it's straight, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna play[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your love make me, oh, crazy than a mother, mother</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All night, makin' love, get each other, love each other</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know you know, I can never love another</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I know you go crazy than a mother, mother</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your love make me, oh, crazy than a mother, mother</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All night, makin' love, get each other, love each other</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know you know, I can never love another</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I know you go crazy than a mother, mother</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Instrumental Outro]</p></div></body></tt>